'@PP+170864'CC String: "Getting started guide - learn more intro"
f pp.String:__In_the_main_screen__behind_the_three_dots_in_the_upper_right_corner__you_can_choose_the_option___Help___=PP+170856
'@PP+170856'CC String: "In the main screen, behind the three dots in the upper right corner, you can choose the option \'Help\'"
f pp.String:__Get_Assistance_=PP+170848
'@PP+170848'CC String: "Get Assistance"
f pp.String:__Getting_started_guide___support_assistance_=PP+170832
'@PP+170832'CC String: "Getting started guide - support assistance"
f pp.String:__If_you_have_any_doubts_or_need_help_at_any_point__you_can_contact_our_support_via_the_app_at_any_time__accessible_from_the_help_screen___and_we_will_do_our_best_to_assist_you._=PP+170824
'@PP+170824'CC String: "If you have any doubts or need help at any point, you can contact our support via the app at any time (accessible from the help screen), and we will do our best to assist you."
f pp.String:__Withdraw_Your_Bitcoin_Rewards_=PP+170816
'@PP+170816'CC String: "Withdraw Your Bitcoin Rewards"
f pp.String:__Getting_started_guide___withdrawal_=PP+170800
'@PP+170800'CC String: "Getting started guide - withdrawal"
f pp.String:__Once_you_meet_the_minimum_withdrawal_amount_and_any_applicable_requirements__you_can_withdraw_Bitcoin_rewards_to_your_own_wallet_or_a_supported_exchange_address._Processing_time_and_fees_may_vary._=PP+170792
'@PP+170792'CC String: "Once you meet the minimum withdrawal amount and any applicable requirements, you can withdraw Bitcoin rewards to your own wallet or a supported exchange address. Processing time and fees may vary."
f pp.String:__Increase_your_loyalty_boost_=PP+170784
'@PP+170784'CC String: "Increase your loyalty boost"
f pp.String:__Getting_started_guide___loyalty_boost_=PP+170768
'@PP+170768'CC String: "Getting started guide - loyalty boost"
f pp.String:__Your_account_has_a_loyalty_multiplier_that_may_boost_rewards_from_all_active_contracts._It_starts_at_1___and_can_grow_as_you_claim_free__rewarded__or_paid_contracts__based_on_our_rules__subject_to_change_._=PP+170760
'@PP+170760'CC String: "Your account has a loyalty multiplier that may boost rewards from all active contracts. It starts at 1× and can grow as you claim free, rewarded, or paid contracts, based on our rules (subject to change)."
f pp.String:__Watch_Bitcoin_Rewards_Accumulate_=PP+170752
'@PP+170752'CC String: "Watch Bitcoin Rewards Accumulate"
f pp.String:__Getting_started_guide___rewards_accumulation_=PP+170736
'@PP+170736'CC String: "Getting started guide - rewards accumulation"
f pp.String:__As_your_plan_runs__rewards_may_build_over_time._Paid_contracts_can_include_a_continuity_boost_that_increases_rewards_the_longer_the_contract_remains_active__per_our_boost_rules__subject_to_change_._=PP+170728
'@PP+170728'CC String: "As your plan runs, rewards may build over time. Paid contracts can include a continuity boost that increases rewards the longer the contract remains active, per our boost rules (subject to change)."
f pp.String:__Start_Mining_=PP+170720
'@PP+170720'CC String: "Start Mining"
f pp.String:__Getting_started_guide___start_mining_=PP+170704
'@PP+170704'CC String: "Getting started guide - start mining"
f pp.String:__Activate_a_plan_by_claiming_free_plan__watching_an_rewarded_ad__or_purchasing__then_mining_progress_starts_automatically._You_can_claim_rewards_when_available._=PP+170696
'@PP+170696'CC String: "Activate a plan by claiming free plan, watching an rewarded ad, or purchasing, then mining progress starts automatically. You can claim rewards when available."
f pp.String:__Choosing_Mining_Plan_=PP+170688
'@PP+170688'CC String: "Choosing Mining Plan"
f pp.String:__Getting_started_guide___choosing_plans_=PP+170672
'@PP+170672'CC String: "Getting started guide - choosing plans"
f pp.String:__Choose_a_free_plan__watch_ads_to_unlock_rewarded_contracts__or_upgrade_to_a_paid_plan_with_higher_hashrate__whatever_fits_your_preferences._=PP+170664
'@PP+170664'CC String: "Choose a free plan, watch ads to unlock rewarded contracts, or upgrade to a paid plan with higher hashrate, whatever fits your preferences."
f pp.String:__Mining_Plans_=PP+170656
'@PP+170656'CC String: "Mining Plans"
f pp.String:__Getting_started_guide___mining_plans_explanation_=PP+170640
'@PP+170640'CC String: "Getting started guide - mining plans explanation"
