f pp.String:__Detailed_explanation_of_hashrate_and_how_to_select_mining_speed_=PP+133056
'@PP+133056'CC String: "Detailed explanation of hashrate and how to select mining speed"
f pp.String:__In_our_system__a_higher_plan_hashrate_can_increase_mining_speed_and_may_lead_to_faster_reward_progress._Hashrate_is_shown_in_GH_s__gigahashes_per_second__or_TH_s__terahashes_per_second___where_1_TH_s_equals_1000_GH_s._n_nTo_adjust_your_mining_speed__move_the_slider_to_the_right_in_the_mining_plan_chooser._Higher_hashrate_plans_usually_cost_more__so_choose_a_plan_that_fits_your_budget_and_preferences._n_nResults_vary_with_real_Bitcoin_network_conditions__including_network_hashrate_difficulty_and_other_factors__=PP+133048
'@PP+133048'CC String: "In our system, a higher plan hashrate can increase mining speed and may lead to faster reward progress. Hashrate is shown in GH/s (gigahashes per second) or TH/s (terahashes per second), where 1 TH/s equals 1000 GH/s.\n\nTo adjust your mining speed, move the slider to the right in the mining plan chooser. Higher hashrate plans usually cost more, so choose a plan that fits your budget and preferences.\n\nResults vary with real Bitcoin network conditions (including network hashrate/difficulty and other factors)"
f pp.String:__Help_modal_title_explaining_hashrate_=PP+133040
'@PP+133040'CC String: "Help modal title explaining hashrate"
f pp.String:__hashrate_help_=PP+133032
'@PP+133032'CC String: "hashrate_help"
f pp.String:__previous_contracts_chevron_=PP+133024
'@PP+133024'CC String: "previous_contracts_chevron"
f pp.String:__power_slider__=PP+133016
