'@PP+133000'CC String: "Instruction text below mining speed slider"
f pp.String:__Drag_slider_above_to_select_hashrate_=PP+132992
'@PP+132992'CC String: "Drag slider above to select hashrate"
f pp.String:__Label_for_mining_speed_hashrate_display_=PP+132928
'@PP+132928'CC String: "Label for mining speed/hashrate display"
f pp.String:__Detailed_explanation_of_different_mining_plan_options_and_durations_=PP+132920
'@PP+132920'CC String: "Detailed explanation of different mining plan options and durations"
f pp.String:__Adjust_your_mining_speed_using_the_slider_above._n_nBelow_the_slider__you__ll_find_different_mining_plan_options._n_nPlans_are_usually_available_in_three_durations:_1_Month__3_Months__Quarterly___and_1_Year._n_nWe_may_also_offer_a_free_plan__claimable_every_8_hours__and_a_rewarded_plan_that_activates_24_hours_of_mining_after_watching_an_ad._n_nPaid_plans_can_provide_higher_hashrate_and_may_lead_to_faster_reward_progress__but_results_vary_with_Bitcoin_network_conditions_and_other_factors._Choose_a_plan_that_fits_your_budget_and_preferences__rewards_are_variable_and_not_guaranteed._=PP+132912
'@PP+132912'CC String: "Adjust your mining speed using the slider above.\n\nBelow the slider, you\'ll find different mining plan options.\n\nPlans are usually available in three durations: 1 Month, 3 Months (Quarterly), and 1 Year.\n\nWe may also offer a free plan (claimable every 8 hours) and a rewarded plan that activates 24 hours of mining after watching an ad.\n\nPaid plans can provide higher hashrate and may lead to faster reward progress, but results vary with Bitcoin network conditions and other factors. Choose a plan that fits your budget and preferences, rewards are variable and not guaranteed."
