'@PP+117032'CC String: "Help dialog explaining mining hashrate and boost system"
f pp.String:__In_our_mining_plans__the_key_factor_is_mining_speed__hashrate___shown_as_values_like_2_GH_s._n_nIn_general__a_higher_hashrate_can_increase_mining_speed_and_may_lead_to_faster_reward_progress__but_outcomes_vary_with_Bitcoin_network_conditions_and_aren__t_guaranteed._n_nPaid_plans_may_include_a_Continuity_Boost_that_can_grow_over_time_while_the_plan_stays_active._Your_account_may_also_have_a_Loyalty_Boost_that_grows_as_you_obtain_and_use_plans_and_applies_across_your_active_plans._n_nContinuity_and_loyalty_boosts_can_stack_together__for_example__2___continuity_and_2___loyalty_combine_to_a_4___boost_under_the_current_rules_._Boosts_are_app_features_that_affect_how_rewards_are_credited_in_the_app__rewards_are_variable_and_not_guaranteed._=PP+117024
'@PP+117024'CC String: "In our mining plans, the key factor is mining speed (hashrate), shown as values like 2 GH/s.\n\nIn general, a higher hashrate can increase mining speed and may lead to faster reward progress, but outcomes vary with Bitcoin network conditions and aren\'t guaranteed.\n\nPaid plans may include a Continuity Boost that can grow over time while the plan stays active. Your account may also have a Loyalty Boost that grows as you obtain and use plans and applies across your active plans.\n\nContinuity and loyalty boosts can stack together (for example, 2× continuity and 2× loyalty combine to a 4× boost under the current rules). Boosts are app features that affect how rewards are credited in the app; rewards are variable and not guaranteed."
