f pp.String:__FAQ_question_about_whether_rewards_are_real_Bitcoin_=PP+76376
'@PP+76376'CC String: "FAQ question about whether rewards are real Bitcoin"
f pp.String:__Are_the_rewards_real_Bitcoin___=PP+76368
'@PP+76368'CC String: "Are the rewards real Bitcoin\?"
f pp.String:__FAQ_answer_confirming_rewards_are_real_Bitcoin_=PP+76360
'@PP+76360'CC String: "FAQ answer confirming rewards are real Bitcoin"
f pp.String:__Yes._Rewards_are_real_Bitcoin__and_once_you_meet_the_minimum_withdrawal_amount_and_any_applicable_requirements__you_can_request_a_withdrawal_and_receive_Bitcoin_to_your_own_wallet_or_a_supported_exchange_address._=PP+76352
'@PP+76352'CC String: "Yes. Rewards are real Bitcoin, and once you meet the minimum withdrawal amount and any applicable requirements, you can request a withdrawal and receive Bitcoin to your own wallet or a supported exchange address."
f pp.String:__FAQ_question_about_Satoshi_denomination_=PP+76344
'@PP+76344'CC String: "FAQ question about Satoshi denomination"
f pp.String:__What_is_Satoshi_or_sat___=PP+76336
'@PP+76336'CC String: "What is Satoshi or sat\?"
f pp.String:__FAQ_answer_explaining_what_Satoshi_denomination_means_=PP+76328
'@PP+76328'CC String: "FAQ answer explaining what Satoshi denomination means"
f pp.String:__Satoshi__often_abbreviated_as___sat____is_a_smaller_denomination_of_Bitcoin._It__s_used_primarily_for_display_and_calculation_purposes._When_we_talk_about_rewards_or_transactions__we_might_use_the_term___Satoshi___to_represent_a_fractional_amount_of_Bitcoin._However__in_our_app_the_underlying_currency_of_your_rewards_and_withdrawals_is_always_Bitcoin._=PP+76320
'@PP+76320'CC String: "Satoshi, often abbreviated as \'sat\', is a smaller denomination of Bitcoin. It\'s used primarily for display and calculation purposes. When we talk about rewards or transactions, we might use the term \'Satoshi\' to represent a fractional amount of Bitcoin. However, in our app the underlying currency of your rewards and withdrawals is always Bitcoin."
f pp.String:__FAQ_question_about_withdrawal_speed_=PP+76312
'@PP+76312'CC String: "FAQ question about withdrawal speed"
f pp.String:__How_quickly_can_I_withdraw_Bitcoin___=PP+76304
'@PP+76304'CC String: "How quickly can I withdraw Bitcoin\?"
f pp.String:__FAQ_answer_about_minimum_withdrawal_requirements_=PP+76296
'@PP+76296'CC String: "FAQ answer about minimum withdrawal requirements"
f pp.String:__You_can_request_a_Bitcoin_withdrawal_as_soon_as_you_reach_the_minimum_withdrawal_limit__which_is_very_low_in__networkName_._Additional_checks_may_apply_to_keep_withdrawals_safe._=PP+76288
'@PP+76288'CC String: "You can request a Bitcoin withdrawal as soon as you reach the minimum withdrawal limit, which is very low in %networkName%. Additional checks may apply to keep withdrawals safe."
f pp.String:__Bitcoin_Lightning_network_=PP+76280
'@PP+76280'CC String: "Bitcoin Lightning network"
f pp.String:__FAQ_question_about_withdrawal_time_=PP+76272
'@PP+76272'CC String: "FAQ question about withdrawal time"
f pp.String:__How_long_it_takes_to_withdraw_Bitcoin___=PP+76264
'@PP+76264'CC String: "How long it takes to withdraw Bitcoin\?"
f pp.String:__FAQ_answer_explaining_withdrawal_timing_on_different_networks_=PP+76256
'@PP+76256'CC String: "FAQ answer explaining withdrawal timing on different networks"
f pp.String:__With_the_Bitcoin_Lightning_Network__many_withdrawals_complete_in_seconds_to_minutes_after_processing__but_timing_depends_on_processing__network_conditions__and_your_wallet_exchange._On_Bitcoin_mainnet__delivery_depends_on_confirmations_and_can_take_longer._Fees__limits__and_security_checks_may_apply._=PP+76248
'@PP+76248'CC String: "With the Bitcoin Lightning Network, many withdrawals complete in seconds to minutes after processing, but timing depends on processing, network conditions, and your wallet/exchange. On Bitcoin mainnet, delivery depends on confirmations and can take longer. Fees, limits, and security checks may apply."
f pp.String:__FAQ_question_about_withdrawing_without_purchase_=PP+76240
'@PP+76240'CC String: "FAQ question about withdrawing without purchase"
f pp.String:__Can_I_withdraw_my_Bitcoin_without_making_a_purchase___=PP+76232
'@PP+76232'CC String: "Can I withdraw my Bitcoin without making a purchase\?"
f pp.String:__FAQ_answer_confirming_withdrawal_without_purchase_is_possible_=PP+76224
'@PP+76224'CC String: "FAQ answer confirming withdrawal without purchase is possible"
f pp.String:__Purchasing_a_plan_is_not_required._You_can_withdraw_Bitcoin_rewards_earned_through_free_or_rewarded_plans_once_your_balance_exceeds_the_minimum_withdrawal_amount_and_any_other_requirements_are_met._=PP+76216
'@PP+76216'CC String: "Purchasing a plan is not required. You can withdraw Bitcoin rewards earned through free or rewarded plans once your balance exceeds the minimum withdrawal amount and any other requirements are met."
