'@PP+73376'CC String: "Clickable link to external Bitcoin mining guide"
f pp.String:___n_nTap_here_to_read_more_comprehensive_guide_on_Bitcoin_mining_=PP+73368
'@PP+73368'CC String: "\n\nTap here to read more comprehensive guide on Bitcoin mining"
f pp.String:__Help_step_4_detailed_description_=PP+73360
'@PP+73360'CC String: "Help step 4 detailed description"
f pp.String:___n_nTo_request_a_withdrawal__go_to_the_Wallet_tab__tap___Withdraw____enter_your_Bitcoin_address_and_the_amount__then_tap___Request_Withdrawal__._After_your_request_is_processed_and_the_transaction_is_broadcast__your_Bitcoin_rewards_should_arrive_once_it_receives_enough_network_confirmations._Processing_time_and_fees_may_vary__and_limits_or_verification_may_apply._=PP+73352
'@PP+73352'CC String: "\n\nTo request a withdrawal, go to the Wallet tab, tap \"Withdraw\", enter your Bitcoin address and the amount, then tap \"Request Withdrawal\". After your request is processed and the transaction is broadcast, your Bitcoin rewards should arrive once it receives enough network confirmations. Processing time and fees may vary, and limits or verification may apply."
f pp.String:__Help_step_4_title_=PP+73344
'@PP+73344'CC String: "Help step 4 title"
f pp.String:__4._Request_a_withdrawal_=PP+73336
'@PP+73336'CC String: "4. Request a withdrawal"
f pp.String:__Help_step_3_detailed_description_=PP+73328
'@PP+73328'CC String: "Help step 3 detailed description"
f pp.String:___n_nYour_mining_plan_can_activate_immediately__and_your_Bitcoin_rewards_can_begin_accumulating_over_time._You_can_track_your_balance_in_real_time_in_the_wallet_tab._Rewards_are_variable_and_not_guaranteed._n_n_=PP+73320
'@PP+73320'CC String: "\n\nYour mining plan can activate immediately, and your Bitcoin rewards can begin accumulating over time. You can track your balance in real time in the wallet tab. Rewards are variable and not guaranteed.\n\n"
