'@PP+73296'CC String: "Help step 2 detailed description"
f pp.String:___n_nTap___Purchase_Subscribe___in_the_lower_right_corner_to_proceed_with_buying_your_chosen_mining_plan_through_your__accountType__account._n_n_=PP+73288
'@PP+73288'CC String: "\n\nTap \'Purchase/Subscribe\' in the lower right corner to proceed with buying your chosen mining plan through your %accountType% account.\n\n"
