'@PP+73248'CC String: "Help step 1 detailed description"
f pp.String:___n_nAdjust_your_hashrate_by_moving_the_slider._Higher_settings_generally_mean_faster_mining_progress_and_may_lead_to_quicker_reward_accumulation__but_results_vary_with_Bitcoin_network_difficulty_and_conditions._Next__select_a_plan_duration__1_month__3_months__or_1_year._Finally__choose_a_renewable_subscription_or_a_one_time_purchase_using_the_toggle_in_the_upper_right_menu._n_n_=PP+73240
'@PP+73240'CC String: "\n\nAdjust your hashrate by moving the slider. Higher settings generally mean faster mining progress and may lead to quicker reward accumulation, but results vary with Bitcoin network difficulty and conditions. Next, select a plan duration, 1 month, 3 months, or 1 year. Finally, choose a renewable subscription or a one-time purchase using the toggle in the upper-right menu.\n\n"
